reads reference via `ech_read_config`, asserts byte equality\n     - `EchE2eSpec` struct: `#[derive(Default)]`, `#[allow(dead_code)]`\n     - `ech_e2e_test_one(_spec)` helper (`todo!()`)\n     - `ech_config` and `ech_config_p` have real API call sequences: `tls_api_init()` → `ech_create_config_from_*` → `ech_save_config` → `ech_test_check_buf`\n     - `ech_e2e`, `ech_e2e_0rtt`, `ech_grease`, `ech_no_ech` construct spec and call `ech_e2e_test_one`\n     - Imports: `crate::{ech_create_config_from_private_key, ech_create_config_from_public_key, ech_read_config, ech_save_config, tls_api_init}`\n\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/edge_cases.rs`** (REWRITTEN)\n     - Static scenarios with `#[allow(dead_code)]`: `SCENARIO_EDGE_CASE`, `SCENARIO_EDGE_RESET`, `SCENARIO_RESET_AT`\n     - Helper functions:\n       - `edge_case_prepare(_edge_case_id, _zero_rtt, _simulated_time, _loss_mask, _nb_init_rounds) -> Result<Box<TestTlsApiCtx>>` (`todo!()`)\n       - `edge_case_complete(test_ctx, simulated_time, duration_max) -> Result<()>` (IMPLEMENTED: calls connection_loop, sets immediate_exit, calls data_sending_loop, calls body_verify)\n       - `reset_repeat_test_one(_kind: ResetTestKind) -> Result<()>` (`todo!()`)\n       - `idle_timeout_test_one(...)` (`todo!()`), `idle_server_test_one(...)` (`todo!()`)\n       - `initial_pto_prepare`, `initial_pto_wait`, `initial_pto_ack` (all `todo!()`)\n       - `crypto_hs_offset_one(_pc: PacketContext) -> Result<()>` (`todo!()`)\n       - `reset_stream_at_test_one(_spec: ResetStreamAtSpec) -> Result<()>` (`todo!()`)\n       - `ec9a_server_loop(test_ctx, simulated_time) -> Result<(i32, u64)>` (`todo!()`)\n     - Enums: `ResetTestKind` (8 variants), `ResetStreamAtSpec` (Basic, Limit, Loss)\n     - 25 test functions (including `error_name` which was already complete)\n     - `reset_loop_test` body is still `todo!(\"reset_loop_test: custom callback + stream manipulation not yet implemented\")` — STILL NEEDS FIXING\n     - `initial_pto` test has real body: